OL,3,APassengers thought mass train attack
OL,4,A'was a joke'
OL,5,
OL,6,FSome train passengers initially
OL,7,Fremained sitting down and thought a man
OL,8,Fwas joking after he told people "I've
OL,9,Fbeen stabbed, run", a court has heard.
OL,11,FAnthony Williams stabbed 10 people on
OL,12,Fthe train which made an unscheduled
OL,13,Fstop in Huntingdon, Cambridgeshire, on
OL,14,F1 November last year.
OL,16,FCambridge Crown Court heard the first
OL,17,Fperson who was stabbed, Jonathan
OL,18,FGjoshe, later asked hospital staff "am
OL,19,FI going to die today?".
OL,23,APub: 04-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG3/39
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
