OL,3,ABritish man infected with Ebola in DR
OL,4,ACongo to be flown back to UK
OL,5,
OL,6,FEarlier, a UK government spokesperson
OL,7,Fsaid there were "well-established
OL,8,Fprocedures for dealing with cases like
OL,9,Fthis" and that the risk to the public
OL,10,Fremains low.
OL,23,APub: 04-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG8/39
