OL,3,AUS midterm results a 'victory' for
OL,4,ACanadians hopeful of tariff relief
OL,5,
OL,6,FTuesday night's result is unlikely to
OL,7,Fgrant Canada relief from those tariffs
OL,8,Fany time soon, but there is
OL,9,Fanticipation that the political shifts
OL,10,Fcould create a more favourable
OL,11,Fenvironment for Ottawa to get the best
OL,12,Fdeal now that on-again-off-again trade
OL,13,Ftalks are back on.
OL,15,FUS voters cited affordability as a main
OL,16,Fconcern heading into the midterms and a
OL,17,Fsurvey by the Cato Institute in
OL,18,FSeptember suggested that about 75%
OL,19,Fbelieve the tariffs have raised prices.
OL,23,APub: 04-NovQpppppppppppppppppppppG12/39
